        "text": "According to Lee T. Paterson, the treating\u2011physician rule determines how disability benefits are evaluated under ERISA, directly affecting claimants\u2019 access to benefits."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "American Medical Association",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c9baf0b805ab217e3adc61aefa38afb95e340433f73ce4cc1452a14673a953f9",
