            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 52
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to American Medical Association, misrepresentation by treating physicians, as highlighted by AMA statistics, can influence the outcome of disability\u2011benefit determinations."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice O'Connor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c9baf0b805ab217e3adc61aefa38afb95e340433f73ce4cc1452a14673a953f9",
