            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice O'Connor, the case raises procedural\u2011fairness questions about whether plan administrators must provide reasons when rejecting a treating physician\u2019s opinion."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
          {
